**Sauce Labs runs your prepared tests on cloud devices and returns execution evidence.** Bitrise builds the packages and invokes the approved integration. Your tests verify application behavior, such as placing a demo chicken order and checking its confirmation.

**Work locations — the application repository, its approved Bitrise workflow, and the Sauce Labs results view.** Read [Writing Tests](./writing-tests.mdx) for test authoring and [Bitrise Pipelines](../cicd/bitrise-pipelines.mdx) for the CI/CD connection.

